@startuml
title ResNet residual block
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

component "Input x" as input
component "Conv 3×3" as conv1
component "BatchNorm" as bn1
component "ReLU" as relu1
component "Conv 3×3" as conv2
component "BatchNorm" as bn2
component "Add" as add
component "ReLU" as relu2
component "Output y" as output

input --> conv1 : feature map
conv1 --> bn1
bn1 --> relu1
relu1 --> conv2
conv2 --> bn2
bn2 --> add : F(x)
input --> add : identity shortcut
add --> relu2
relu2 --> output

note right of add
  y = ReLU(F(x) + x)
  If dimensions differ,
  use a 1×1 projection
  on the shortcut path.
end note
@enduml
